        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>An aether-forged gunblade discipline that channels combustion through steel. Gunbreakers hold the front line and answer blows with chambered fury.</em></p><h2>Key Ability</h2><p>STR or DEX.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p>10 + your Constitution modifier per level.</p><h2>Class Features</h2><p>You gain class features at the levels shown below; they are added to your sheet automatically when you take this class.</p><ul><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.fe03ab566ecd7e59]{Powder Gauge}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.04cbd7c7e3159f9e]{Gunbreaker's Combo}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.1f7a9715421e92da]{Royal Guard}, Gunbreaker feat</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.a61994a226d98bcc]{Steady Aim}, general feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>4th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.7ea8bba45957ea76]{Gunblade Weapon Mastery}, ancestry feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>6th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>7th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.141e49ccd412a33a]{Continuation}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.a40dd44fb62beb04]{Weapon Specialization}, general feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>8th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>9th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.ad484df0b1baae4e]{Aetheric Fortitude}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.0034c6c64e887ff7]{Cartridge Expertise}, ancestry feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>10th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>11th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.0a3b3f4bfc68b3d1]{Gunbreaker Expertise}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.0e4bd01ae207e03c]{Armor Expertise}, general feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>12th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>13th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.a5ca84e5a87ea0ea]{Gunblade Legend}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.571c5710dc92e12d]{Battle-Tested}, ancestry feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>14th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>15th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.5ee5fcd559eedf13]{Greater Weapon Specialization}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.70faa71375db332e]{Armor Mastery}, general feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>16th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>17th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.81fc94e9fc8dcc22]{Gunbreaker Mastery}, ancestry feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>18th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li><li><strong>19th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.a7bcbcad2fd2a303]{Lion's Legend}, general feat, skill increase</li><li><strong>20th</strong> Gunbreaker feat, skill feat</li></ul><h2>Proficiencies (1st level)</h2><p>Perception trained; Fortitude expert; Reflex & Will trained; gunblades/simple/martial trained; light & medium armor trained; class DC trained (STR or DEX); 3 + Int skills.</p>",
